    "blurb": "AI-powered email classification and filing engine",
    "overview": "Classify incoming emails by topic and file them into the right Microsoft Outlook folder automatically. Camunda orchestrates privacy-safe AI classification with Amazon Bedrock, with a review folder for unclear cases.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Stop sorting email by hand",
    "splashDescription": "Invoices, customer requests, contracts, and newsletters all land in the same inbox, and sorting them by hand costs time every day while the one email that really matters is easy to miss. This blueprint turns a cluttered inbox into a structured, topic-based filing system without any manual effort. As soon as an email arrives, Camunda masks personal data, classifies the email with an LLM on Amazon Bedrock, and files it into the matching Microsoft Outlook folder. Emails the AI is unsure about go to a review folder for a human decision. Privacy by design, human-in-the-loop review, and full process transparency make the solution suitable for organizations with strict compliance requirements.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/873327/overview/img17809362522211894519.png?d25b533828218c1cc334d36cffcb0897",
